# Prisma repositories

## Layout

```
persistence/repositories/<entity>/
  prisma-<entity>.repository.ts
  <entity>.relations.ts
  <entity>-write-error.mapper.ts

persistence/row-mappers/<entity>/
  <entity>.row.types.ts
  map-<entity>-row.ts
  index.ts
```

Bind TOKEN in `infrastructure/modules/<entity>/` — not ad-hoc in controllers.

## Rules

- `extends PrismaReadRepository` + `implements` domain `I*Repository` (list/preset entities)
- `getDelegate(scope?)`: `unwrapPrismaTxFromScope(scope)` or `this.prisma`
- Writes require `scope`; try/catch → write-error mapper
- Update: only keys `!== undefined`, including `null`
- Row mapper: only Prisma → domain; nest via other `map*Row`
- Write-error: `P2002`→AlreadyExists, `P2025`→NotFound, `P2003`→FK NotFound
- No ACL / enrichment / HTTP shaping
- `@prisma/client` stays in infrastructure

